msgid "If Yuva answers with a server error, does not answer within 20 seconds or cannot be reached, the Worker can forward the message to an address you choose, as long as you set FALLBACK_FORWARD. That address must be a verified destination in Email Routing. The message then arrives as a plain forward and does not appear in Yuva. Without FALLBACK_FORWARD the delivery fails with an error and the sending server may retry later."
msgstr "Jika Yuva menjawab dengan kesalahan server, tidak menjawab dalam 20 detik, atau tidak dapat dijangkau, Worker dapat meneruskan pesan ke alamat yang Anda pilih, selama Anda mengatur FALLBACK_FORWARD. Alamat itu harus berupa tujuan terverifikasi di Email Routing. Pesan lalu tiba sebagai penerusan biasa dan tidak muncul di Yuva. Tanpa FALLBACK_FORWARD, pengiriman gagal dengan kesalahan dan server pengirim dapat mencoba lagi nanti."

