#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "The Worker is one way to call /ingress/email. Any mail server or relay can post the raw message with the same signed headers, and a mail server that delivers to a command can pipe the message into yuva ingest-email. The request format is documented in the Worker's README."
msgstr "Worker adalah salah satu cara memanggil /ingress/email. Server surat atau relay apa pun dapat mengirim pesan mentah dengan header bertanda tangan yang sama, dan server surat yang mengirim ke sebuah perintah dapat menyalurkan pesan ke yuva ingest-email. Format permintaannya didokumentasikan di README Worker."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "The Worker signs the raw message, both envelope addresses and a timestamp with HMAC-SHA256 under a secret you share with Yuva, and sends them to /ingress/email on your Yuva server."
msgstr "Worker menandatangani pesan mentah, kedua alamat amplop, dan stempel waktu dengan HMAC-SHA256 menggunakan rahasia yang Anda bagikan dengan Yuva, lalu mengirimnya ke /ingress/email di server Yuva Anda."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "The Yuva chat widget open on a newsletter tool's website: the visitor's question and a member's reply, with the member shown online."
msgstr "Widget obrolan Yuva terbuka di situs web alat buletin: pertanyaan pengunjung dan balasan anggota, dengan anggota ditampilkan daring."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "The Yuva Email Worker reads the raw message and the envelope, signs the request and posts it to Yuva. Parsing, threading and spam decisions stay on the server."
msgstr "Yuva Email Worker membaca pesan mentah dan amplop, menandatangani permintaan, dan mengirimkannya ke Yuva. Penguraian, pengutasan, dan keputusan spam tetap di server."

